                 {
                     "type":  "TextBlock",
                     "text":  "**Was Valley Chainsaw intentionally enrolled only for Boat DWA, or should they also carry Motorcycle / Powersport products?**",
                     "wrap":  true,
                     "spacing":  "None"
                 },
                 {
                     "type":  "TextBlock",
                     "text":  "1. Notify Sam, Zach and Mark that the Ghostrider dealer-code issue is fixed and close the original ticket.\n2. If Valley Chainsaw should carry powersport products, raise a DCR to add the Powersport DWA and VSC assignments on YM795720.\n3. Retest Dockside (YM795710) now that it is enrolled.",
                     "wrap":  true,
                     "spacing":  "Small"
