                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "weight":  "Bolder",
                                       "spacing":  "Medium",
                                       "size":  "Small"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "1. Dealer status - PASS - all nine codes resolve to active EAS dealers except M\u0026P Mercury (not enrolled)\n2. Product assigned - PASS - YMBG/YMGP/APVS/YMRS open to 9999-12-31 on the eight enrolled codes; Valley Chainsaw carries YMBG only\n3. eContract forms - PASS - YMBDWA-CAN-822 and YMMDWACAN-822 eContract-enabled\n4. Rates - PASS - rate systems 1312/1307/1308/1278 open; RATE_SKU_YAMAHA live rows present\n5. Vehicle eligibility - SKIPPED - no VIN supplied\n0. Duplicate check - NOT checked - no VIN or SR",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "size":  "Small",
                                       "spacing":  "None"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "Root cause",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "weight":  "Bolder",
                                       "spacing":  "Medium",
                                       "size":  "Small"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "Inovatec had Ghostrider mapped to the wrong Safe-Guard dealer code, so its requests resolved to a shell with no products. Corrected 2026-09-03; DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE for dealer_id 58271 (program 20336) shows APVS/YMBG/YMGP/YMRS open and SG_CON_M1 shows YMRS contracts on 2026-09-01 and 2026-09-07.\n\nValley Chainsaw (YM795720) is correctly mapped but enrolled on YMBG (Boat DWA) only, so any motorcycle/ATV/snowmobile request returns an empty product list: \"No products were available for this dealer.\" That is working as configured, not an API fault.",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "size":  "Small",
                                       "spacing":  "None"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "How this was verified",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "weight":  "Bolder",
                                       "spacing":  "Medium",
                                       "size":  "Small"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "1. Ghostrider live - DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE for dealer_id 58271 returned 4 open rows (APVS, YMBG, YMGP, YMRS) with EXPIRATION_SALE_DATE 9999-12-31.\n2. Ghostrider transacting - SG_CON_M1 where SG_CON_DEALER = YM900149 returned 2 YMRS contracts, status A, 2026-09-01 and 2026-09-07.\n3. Valley Chainsaw scope - DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE for YM795720 returned a single open row, YMBG; RATE_SYSTEM_APPLICATION shows only rate system 1307.\n4. Working dealers - the six YM codes marked working each returned open product rows and open rate systems for YMBG and YMGP in DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE / RATE_SYSTEM_APPLICATION.\n5. M\u0026P Mercury - no row in V_DEALER for any YM code matching the name; reported to Inovatec as not enrolled.",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "isSubtle":  true,
                                       "spacing":  "None",
                                       "size":  "Small"
